    "No original tests, HTTP, model, provider, service, build or credential access performed.",
    "Exact owner source availability is custody, not current behavioral/installed qualification.",
    "Existing retained validators preserve packet checks and adverse outcomes; historical fixtures are not new provider acceptance.",
    "Standalone native_qwen and ANRM tools excluded: not justified as obsolete monolith interfaces."
